    <string name="consent_row_target">Target</string>
    <string name="consent_persistence_value">%1$s, reboot clears</string>
    <string name="consent_risk_title">Reset risk</string>
    <string name="consent_risk_body">The init relay never returns to init. The next init log can consume the logging thread and the phone may watchdog-reset. Memory-only; reboot clears.</string>
    <string name="consent_init_extra">After a verified write, trigger init from the workstation:\n\nadb shell setprop ctl.start zzz\n\nThe command may hang once the relay is live. The app cannot connect to @dfi_init; the shell domain can. The relay may watchdog-reset the phone.</string>
    <string name="consent_bt_extra">The write alone does not execute code. A readable GATT peripheral and a live gatt_act_read are required. After the write, check /dev/.dfib and @dfi_bt from the shell domain. This app does not connect to Bluetooth.</string>
