    <string name="about_limits">Limits</string>
    <string name="about_limits_body">One verified device row. The app stages the relay but never consumes it. The relay is an unauthenticated raw-syscall RPC that never returns to init; treat it as a measured research artifact. The debug certificate is not a distribution identity, and a release build should not ship this artifact without a separate review.</string>
